{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_40", "source_id": "62fa3cab0000000015008f05", "title": "常年生活在夏季但一点没黑，我真的会谢", "content_type": "normal", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_62fa3cab0000000015008f05", "topic_family": "防晒", "mechanism_key": "problem_result", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 1158, "evidence_unit_count": 42, "original_evidence_unit_count": 42, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 0, "transcript_available": false, "evidence_basis": "image_ocr_and_publish_text", "traceable_anchors": ["生活在常年夏天的城市，防晒真是太重要了 我一般出行硬防晒软防晒都会做到位，", "涂匀成膜之后很干爽, 油痘肌不用担心，它完全不致痘，", "这也是很多人不愿意擦防晒的原因 但你们试试兰蔻小白管防晒，", "摸匀之后 一点不泛白 也没有油光 看不出擦过防晒", "防晒霜+帽子+墨镜 夏日出行必备", "所以我脸上没有一颗斑， 大家问我长过那么多痘还感觉皮肤很细腻，", "但我是油痘肌， 所以在防晒的选择上会更严格，需要一瓶"], "retained_quotes": ["所以我脸上没有一颗斑， 大家问我长过那么多痘还感觉皮肤很细腻，", "但我是油痘肌， 所以在防晒的选择上会更严格，需要一瓶"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_62fa3cab0000000015008f05/images/ocr.json", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_62fa3cab0000000015008f05/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_62fa3cab0000000015008f05/source.json", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_62fa3cab0000000015008f05/images", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "92d7cb782cdd579f86f6ef4a1c7a96a251103d4fcd3e85c9cdd6d3a9c3a35915", "card_hash": "0aff4afd46163685062ed1bf18d2a5bab68b02b0e364cd1161ba5894443fb57d", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_40", "source_id": "62f08aa9000000001b024588", "title": "熬夜后怎么补救|皮肤细腻饱满的秘诀", "content_type": "normal", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_62f08aa9000000001b024588", "topic_family": "提亮与肤色", "mechanism_key": "time_feedback", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 915, "evidence_unit_count": 30, "original_evidence_unit_count": 30, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 0, "transcript_available": false, "evidence_basis": "image_ocr_and_publish_text", "traceable_anchors": ["每次发现新的好用护肤品都好兴奋 这是我最近发现的一个冷门大宝藏：", "脸部也是细腻饱满的状态 话说回来 如果不做抗氧化，那等于抗老就白做了", "其实很多护肤品用完就感觉用了个寂寞，包括贵价的", "希望每个女孩的皮肤都能变的水灵灵的️ #修丽可抗氧化[话题]##修丽可早C晚B[话题]##修丽可日夜抗氧[话题]##去黄提亮[话题]##熬夜后怎么补救[话题]#", "真的能提升肤质 第二天摸脸感觉嫩嫩滑滑 效果因人而异", "脸部也是细腻饱满的状态 话说回来 如果不做抗氧化，那等于抗老就白做了", "但我比较贪心，所以后续还会加别的 把我最近的心头好分享给你们，"], "retained_quotes": ["脸部也是细腻饱满的状态 话说回来 如果不做抗氧化，那等于抗老就白做了", "但我比较贪心，所以后续还会加别的 把我最近的心头好分享给你们，"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_62f08aa9000000001b024588/images/ocr.json", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_62f08aa9000000001b024588/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_62f08aa9000000001b024588/source.json", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_62f08aa9000000001b024588/images", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "daa623cd2222423e569eb4c334d9efaee94acf8e673d21d35b31de927d549eb0", "card_hash": "6ed51381a8a561fa9c6a976cbb0916ed723549818d311da59fe2fffae61906ea", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_40", "source_id": "62ea2209000000001202c728", "title": "油痘肌早晚间护肤，跟我一起变成水光肌～", "content_type": "video", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_62ea2209000000001202c728", "topic_family": "提亮与肤色", "mechanism_key": "problem_result", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 1094, "evidence_unit_count": 33, "original_evidence_unit_count": 33, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 105, "transcript_available": true, "evidence_basis": "video_transcript_and_frames", "traceable_anchors": ["Hello 我是小森林 這一期想和你們分享一下 我最近的一個日常早晚間護膚", "如果你們感興趣的話可以看一下 這個精華我在網上看網友說 在我們臉上乾的時候用它會更好", "我釋出了兩個豆子呢 現在呢留了兩個豆印 所以我還會在我的豆印這邊呢", "就是你前面不要擦霜水 直接裸臉上圓形理C 這樣它的效果會更好", "都沒有悶動 我準備再用幾次看看 那我的成交戶要完成了", "在我的臉上有啾啾把乾的感覺 所以我一般都會再加一個清爽的保濕", "如果你們感興趣的話可以看一下 這個精華我在網上看網友說 在我們臉上乾的時候用它會更好"], "retained_quotes": ["在我的臉上有啾啾把乾的感覺 所以我一般都會再加一個清爽的保濕", "如果你們感興趣的話可以看一下 這個精華我在網上看網友說 在我們臉上乾的時候用它會更好"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_62ea2209000000001202c728/video/transcript.txt", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_62ea2209000000001202c728/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_62ea2209000000001202c728/video/source.mp4", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_62ea2209000000001202c728/video/frames", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "7299560917cce98113fc3dffa0a1c91116d6fa327f5e5369983af97a4f63e11d", "card_hash": "b03feb60d16ca9ad59beb398df3a781aa1b0b6a9997188587110d1e4d6b4638d", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_40", "source_id": "62e62fda000000000e032015", "title": "油痘肌好用物分享❤️", "content_type": "video", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_62e62fda000000000e032015", "topic_family": "痘肌与痘印", "mechanism_key": "step_sequence", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 874, "evidence_unit_count": 25, "original_evidence_unit_count": 25, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 81, "transcript_available": true, "evidence_basis": "video_transcript_and_frames", "traceable_anchors": ["Hello 我是小三菱 一直以来都是我给你们种草 今天我来做一期粉丝好用物推荐", "有轻微的控油效果 我给它取了一个外号叫解腻神器 就是有时候我们会用到一些粘膩的护肤品", "一点都不会觉得身上很干燥 它抹匀了之后 吸收了一两分钟就变得很干爽", "用它画完蚝残之后会显得眼睛 很圆很萌 有一种日本女孩卡哇伊的感觉", "欢迎你们继续来给我安利 攒够的安利的话 我就录下一期粉丝安利好拥武 那我们下期见 拜拜", "让更多的人知道他们 先说这个绿茶精华 我觉得它特别适合我们游斗机", "如果我的单擦它这一个 我还觉得有一点不够保湿了 如果你是一个觉得用什么都很闷斗"], "retained_quotes": ["让更多的人知道他们 先说这个绿茶精华 我觉得它特别适合我们游斗机", "如果我的单擦它这一个 我还觉得有一点不够保湿了 如果你是一个觉得用什么都很闷斗"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_62e62fda000000000e032015/video/transcript.txt", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_62e62fda000000000e032015/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_62e62fda000000000e032015/video/source.mp4", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_62e62fda000000000e032015/video/frames", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "2a4ab8ff0c558f4f080a3eebef26d70406b16a4328550f473004efc89b84ea80", "card_hash": "c044580a62de107cf863c7d1077f63bb3b6d97d9b319488486b38981bec48a98", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
