{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_40", "source_id": "62d7bb5c000000001200188c", "title": "极简护肤我爱了", "content_type": "normal", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_62d7bb5c000000001200188c", "topic_family": "其他护肤经验", "mechanism_key": "problem_result", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 1067, "evidence_unit_count": 31, "original_evidence_unit_count": 31, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 0, "transcript_available": false, "evidence_basis": "image_ocr_and_publish_text", "traceable_anchors": ["我是一个长了9年痘痘闭口的油痘肌，现在皮肤被我保养的蛮好，细腻、光滑、不会随意长痘痘闭口了", "用这一套早上起床气色也很好，脸上白白净净", "（脸颊敏感的话最好不要擦到） 再按压3、4泵乳（很清爽，完全可以吸收～），在手心搓开后，按压上脸", "自自净净~ 效果因人而异 97:3的水油比例", "护肤完成~ 脸好清爽呀~ 早上起床，脸白白净净～ 效果因人而算", "分享一下我的护肤经验～ 油痘肌护肤不能粘黏腻腻，护肤品的选择上一定要清爽再清爽，特别是在夏天", "使用方法： 先把极光水左右摇匀，再倒在棉片上，轻轻的擦拭我们角质层厚，容易长黑头、闭口的区域"], "retained_quotes": ["分享一下我的护肤经验～ 油痘肌护肤不能粘黏腻腻，护肤品的选择上一定要清爽再清爽，特别是在夏天", "使用方法： 先把极光水左右摇匀，再倒在棉片上，轻轻的擦拭我们角质层厚，容易长黑头、闭口的区域"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_62d7bb5c000000001200188c/images/ocr.json", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_62d7bb5c000000001200188c/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_62d7bb5c000000001200188c/source.json", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_62d7bb5c000000001200188c/images", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "f27149daecf2ecf20b780a92237a60446c0418dff2c53f35363c8793a2ba07d3", "card_hash": "b15a1729e2cc65e100fd0a4728df420581bb4df0fa187fcbccf4315934fa7cb8", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
